  RECONCILIATION of (d): the literal summed ratio anti-correlates with the dense beta (Spearman -0.720, p=0.0055), but the order-consistent variant F00-family c2/c0 correlates strongly positively (Spearman +0.984, p=0.0000). F20_0/F00_0 falls from 1.321 to 0.262 between 22.5 and 48.4 eV while F20_2/F00_2 tracks the dense beta, so the sign of the summed proxy is set by an energy-dependent order mix inside the F20 family, not by the energy trend.
